87	// PC-trigger mode: when enter_pc_arg is non-zero (set via plugin arg
88	// `enter_pc=0x...`), the CSR-insn matcher is bypassed entirely and the
89	// drain callback is registered only for instructions whose vaddr equals
90	// enter_pc_arg. The kind reported on the drain is HYBRID_HANDOFF_ENTER
91	// (entry into vsim), matching marker-mode enter-marker semantics.
